### Listar todas as notas
GET http://localhost:8080/notas



### Criar nota fiscal (primeira vez - deve dar 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/notas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": "99999",
  "cnpjEmissor": "12345678000199",
  "dataEmissao": "2026-09-20",
  "valorTotal": 150.50
}

### Repetir a mesma nota (deve dar 409 agora)
POST http://localhost:8080/notas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "numero": "99999",
  "cnpjEmissor": "12345678000199",
  "dataEmissao": "2026-09-20",
  "valorTotal": 999.00
}